<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia May passenger car sales 23,819 units.</title>
<headline>Malaysia May passenger car sales 23,819 units.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's passenger car sales, including four-wheel-drive vehicles for private use, totalled 23,819 units in May against 20,123 in May last year, the Malaysian Motor Traders Association (MMTA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Commercial vehicle sales, including four-by-four vehicles used for business, totalled 8,121 units in May 1997 against 6,547 in May 1996.</p>
</text>
